</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Among the saints on earth</l><l>Let mutual love be found;</l><l>Heirs of the same inheritance,</l><l>With mutual blessings crowned.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Let envy, child of hell!</l><l>Be banished far away:</l><l>Those in sweet fellowship should dwell,</l><l>Who the same Lord obey.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Thus will the Church below</l><l>God’s purpose ever prove;</l><l>Where streams of endless pleasure flow,</l><l>And every heart is love.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
